<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill raises certain retailers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill raises certain retailers.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Circuit City Stores Inc-Circuit City Group to near-term accumulate from neutral. Merrill said it kept Circuit City at long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- said raised Tandy Corp to near-term buy from neutral and to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said it upgraded Borders Group Inc to near-term buy from accumulate. Merrill said it kept Borders at long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
</text>
